# This file exists so the directory survives `git clone`.
#
# The pg-backup container mounts ./secrets/backup-public.asc (or whatever
# BACKUP_GPG_PUBLIC_KEY_PATH points at in your .env) read-only at
# /etc/freesdn/gpg/backup-public.asc inside the container. When the file
# isn't a valid GPG public key the container falls back to writing
# UNENCRYPTED dumps with a prominent warning.
#
# To enable encryption see ./README.md in this directory.
